;
PUBLIC COMMAND REFERENCE

A - BYE      Log off
B - CHAT     Page the sysop
C - CLS      Clear display
D - DIR      List files
E - HELP     Using online help
F - LDIR     List library members
G - LT       Read text and library members
H - MESSAGE  Leave a note for the sysop
I - MOUNT    List or exchange library volumes
J - NDSCAN   Refresh named directories
K - RBBS     Enter the bulletin board
L - SDZ      Super Directory
M - TYPE     Display ordinary text
N - UPLOAD   Send files to the sysop
O - YSEND    Download using YMODEM

